  (text "U20 G9SA-321-T075 OFF-delay safety relay (DIN rail) and U27 photoMOS (LATCH in ch1)" (at 25.4 40 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "653c6b28-a647-55dc-ac80-c2c4b7e50d16"))
  (text "Base switch Q9 / U21 LM5069-1 (soft-start, 35 A breaker): VIN → VBUS_B, enable through U20" (at 25.4 96.48 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "10aa6608-4a33-5c85-9a66-61fd3078e51d"))
  (text "Base clamp leg: R7 NH-50 (chassis) ∥ D7, Q10; U23 window, U24 50 µs, U25 FORCE_B 100 ms → U56 → U31 (U22b) UCC27517" (at 215.349 40 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a9fef740-8246-599d-94f9-ffd25b2bff38"))
  (text "Base watchdog U22 (GPIO23, 25 ms) → WD_B; DISC_B (U26): VBUS_B up ∧ ¬EN > 50 ms → GPIO24" (at 411.3745 40 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "39af1397-e1bc-5b05-bf91-ecfaad6729b2"))
  (text "Caster-release solenoid driver Q11 on VBUS_B (gate from the Pi, 100k pull-down)" (at 411.3745 265.337 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "89bdc97b-deae-5d8f-9ff0-8dfb824fc77d"))
  (text "Robot board only: not populated on the M1 bench (Variant = robot); JP1 ties WD_B high on M1.\nVBUS_B is fed from VIN by Q9, never from VBUS after K1; no diode from VBUS_B to VBUS.\nU21 EN <- +24V_L - U20 47-48 - U20 57-58 (both OFF-delay NO contacts in series)." (at 25.4 567 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f95e54f3-302e-5765-825f-cdcbdf353897"))
